WEBVTT

00:09.968 --> 00:11.219
Wake up.

00:12.303 --> 00:13.888
Hey, wake up now.

00:14.639 --> 00:15.724
Wake up.

00:15.807 --> 00:18.018
Hey, do you hear me?

00:18.101 --> 00:20.228
Hey, damn you!

00:20.311 --> 00:22.021
How long are you going to sleep?

00:22.105 --> 00:23.690
You better wake up now!

00:26.151 --> 00:27.569
What?

00:27.652 --> 00:29.904
I heard a Demon Slayer Corps member
is accompanied by a demon.

00:29.988 --> 00:32.198
I was looking forward
to a flamboyant and amazing person.

00:33.074 --> 00:35.076
He ended up being an ordinary guy.

00:37.704 --> 00:39.456
All right, next up.

00:39.539 --> 00:41.583
We must put this young man on trial.

00:41.666 --> 00:42.667
I see.

00:46.087 --> 00:49.424
He has been protecting his sister
who turned into a demon.

00:50.508 --> 00:52.385
The love between siblings is so touching.

00:52.469 --> 00:53.887
What a strong child.

00:55.096 --> 00:57.057
Who's this--

00:57.140 --> 00:59.309
You have no right to speak here, idiot.

00:59.392 --> 01:01.519
Think about who these people are.

01:01.603 --> 01:03.188
The Hashiras are standing in front of you.

01:07.400 --> 01:08.651
Hashiras…

01:08.735 --> 01:10.236
What's a Hashira?

01:11.154 --> 01:12.655
What's going on?

01:13.865 --> 01:15.950
Who are these people?

01:22.040 --> 01:23.750
Where am I?

01:26.711 --> 01:29.088
This is the headquarters
of Demon Slayer Corps.

01:29.714 --> 01:32.717
Your trial will begin now.

01:33.593 --> 01:35.386
Tanjiro Kamado.

03:13.776 --> 03:17.989
DESTROY

03:18.072 --> 03:20.116
Before your trial begins,

03:20.199 --> 03:22.327
I shall state the crime you committed--

03:22.410 --> 03:24.037
I don't think a trial is needed!

03:26.664 --> 03:27.874
THE FLAME HASHIRA, KYOJURO RENGOKU

03:27.957 --> 03:30.960
The act of protecting a demon
is obviously against the corps rules.

03:31.044 --> 03:33.338
We can handle this ourselves.

03:33.421 --> 03:35.340
Let's behead him together with the demon.

03:36.716 --> 03:37.967
THE SOUND HASHIRA, TENGEN UZUI

03:38.051 --> 03:40.970
I shall behead him flamboyantly.

03:41.054 --> 03:44.515
Let his fresh blood splatter flamboyantly.
Nobody can do it better than me.

03:44.599 --> 03:46.392
There's no upper limit to flamboyance.

03:47.685 --> 03:48.937
THE LOVE HASHIRA, MITSURI KANROJI

03:49.020 --> 03:50.313
Seriously?

03:50.396 --> 03:53.608
Are we going to kill such a cute child?

03:53.691 --> 03:55.276
My heart hurts.

03:55.360 --> 03:56.653
I feel so sad.

03:57.695 --> 03:58.905
THE STONE HASHIRA, GYOMEI HIMEJIMA

03:58.988 --> 04:02.450
I see. How could there be
such a poor child?

04:03.034 --> 04:04.285
How pitiful.

04:05.036 --> 04:08.206
His birth itself is a tragedy.

04:09.707 --> 04:11.000
THE MIST HASHIRA, MUICHIRO TOKITO

04:11.084 --> 04:13.378
How should I describe the cloud's shape?

04:14.545 --> 04:16.297
What was it called again?

04:17.507 --> 04:18.591
Where's Nezuko?

04:19.217 --> 04:20.343
Nezuko.

04:21.803 --> 04:23.263
You.

04:23.346 --> 04:26.182
The Hashiras are talking to you.
Where are you looking at?

04:26.933 --> 04:28.685
These ladies and gentlemen

04:28.768 --> 04:32.480
are the highest-ranked swordsmen
within Demon Slayer Corps.

04:33.940 --> 04:35.149
Hashiras.

04:36.901 --> 04:38.236
Let's kill him.

04:39.153 --> 04:41.155
Yes, kill him flamboyantly.

04:42.699 --> 04:43.783
Hey!

04:43.866 --> 04:45.285
Nezuko.

04:45.368 --> 04:46.953
Where are you, Nezuko?

04:47.870 --> 04:48.955
Nezuko.

04:49.038 --> 04:50.123
Zenitsu!

04:50.790 --> 04:52.000
Inosuke!

04:52.083 --> 04:53.334
Mr. Murata!

04:54.002 --> 04:57.213
Let's put this aside.
What are we going to do with Tomioka?

05:03.344 --> 05:08.099
He's not even tied up
and it's giving me a headache.

05:08.182 --> 05:12.729
According to that Kocho girl,
Tomioka also broke the corps rules.

05:12.812 --> 05:14.230
THE SERPENT HASHIRA, OBANAI IGURO

05:14.314 --> 05:15.732
How should we punish him?

05:15.815 --> 05:17.650
What kind of responsibility does he bear?

05:17.734 --> 05:19.694
How should we make him suffer?

05:22.864 --> 05:25.950
Say something, Tomioka.

05:29.829 --> 05:32.206
It was my fault
for implicating Mr. Tomioka.

05:33.875 --> 05:37.670
Mr. Iguro is still his usual self.
Entangles persistently like a snake.

05:37.754 --> 05:39.338
His persistence is so cool!

05:46.262 --> 05:47.680
Mr. Tomioka!

05:47.764 --> 05:50.016
He's standing far away by himself.

05:50.099 --> 05:51.476
How cute!

05:52.894 --> 05:54.020
THE WATER HASHIRA, GIYU TOMIOKA

05:54.103 --> 05:55.813
It's nothing much.

05:55.897 --> 05:57.899
He came here willingly anyway.

05:58.983 --> 06:01.277
Let's think about his punishment later.

06:01.986 --> 06:04.530
THE INSECT HASHIRA, SHINOBU KOCHO

06:05.073 --> 06:09.160
Most importantly,
I have a question for the boy.

06:09.869 --> 06:12.413
Boy, as a member of Demon Slayer Corps,

06:12.497 --> 06:15.208
you brought a demon along
for your missions.

06:15.291 --> 06:19.087
Regarding this matter,
I would like to hear your explanation.

06:19.170 --> 06:22.882
But of course, the action itself
has already broken the corps rules.

06:24.801 --> 06:26.677
You know that, don't you?

06:31.349 --> 06:32.725
Tanjiro Kamado.

06:33.643 --> 06:37.647
Why did you bring a demon along
as a member of Demon Slayer Corps?

06:39.524 --> 06:41.025
We don't have to listen to him.

06:42.819 --> 06:44.654
It's okay. Take your time.

06:44.737 --> 06:45.988
Please tell me your reason.

06:50.493 --> 06:51.661
My…

06:51.744 --> 06:52.829
My younger sister…

07:02.839 --> 07:05.216
You better drink some water.

07:09.679 --> 07:13.224
Since you hurt your jaw,
please drink slowly.

07:14.434 --> 07:17.145
I added painkillers into the water.
You'll feel better.

07:25.027 --> 07:28.448
It won't heal your injuries though,
so don't push yourself too hard.

07:30.199 --> 07:32.702
Well, Tanjiro Kamado.

07:36.789 --> 07:38.875
The demon is my younger sister.

07:39.667 --> 07:42.420
When I left my house,
my family was attacked by a demon.

07:42.503 --> 07:44.338
When I reached home, everyone was dead.

07:45.298 --> 07:47.341
Although my younger sister
turned into a demon,

07:47.425 --> 07:49.051
she never consumes human flesh before.

07:49.635 --> 07:51.971
She won't eat humans. Not now, not ever.

07:53.181 --> 07:56.184
She'll never hurt humans!

07:56.684 --> 07:59.937
Don't make such a reckless remark
in front of me.

08:00.021 --> 08:02.899
Since she's your family,
of course you're on her side.

08:02.982 --> 08:05.276
Everything you said can't be trusted.

08:05.359 --> 08:07.111
I won't trust you.

08:07.945 --> 08:11.616
So is he assimilated into a demon?

08:12.366 --> 08:16.245
Kill this pitiful child quickly
and set him free.

08:17.246 --> 08:18.873
Please listen to me!

08:18.956 --> 08:22.585
I became a swordsman to treat Nezuko!

08:22.668 --> 08:26.130
Nezuko has been a demon
for more than two years.

08:26.214 --> 08:28.716
Nezuko never ate humans
during this period!

08:29.509 --> 08:32.803
You're talking in circles, fool.

08:33.304 --> 08:34.889
Never eaten humans.

08:34.972 --> 08:36.474
Won't eat humans in the future.

08:37.266 --> 08:40.061
Don't just talk.
Show me some flamboyant proof.

08:45.191 --> 08:47.193
What's the name of that bird?

08:48.819 --> 08:50.154
Well…

08:50.238 --> 08:51.489
So…

08:52.156 --> 08:54.408
I have a question.

08:54.909 --> 08:58.996
I think it's impossible
that Lord Oyakata doesn't know about this.

09:02.458 --> 09:05.336
Can we really handle this ourselves?

09:10.466 --> 09:12.969
Before Lord Oyakata's arrival,
I think we should just wait.

09:13.052 --> 09:14.262
My younger sister!

09:14.345 --> 09:16.681
My younger sister will fight with me!

09:17.348 --> 09:21.143
As a member of Demon Slayer Corps,
she'll fight to protect mankind!

09:21.227 --> 09:22.311
So…

09:23.229 --> 09:26.941
Well, it seems things
are getting interesting.

09:30.069 --> 09:33.114
The foolish member accompanied
by a demon is him, right?

09:38.828 --> 09:41.414
What kind of motive do you have?

09:41.497 --> 09:42.832
THE WIND HASHIRA, SANEMI SHINAZUGAWA

09:44.000 --> 09:45.418
Mr. Shinazugawa.

09:45.501 --> 09:47.712
The scar on his body has increased.
How wonderful!

09:48.379 --> 09:50.590
This will get me in trouble,
Lord Shinazugawa!

09:50.673 --> 09:53.092
Please put the box down!

09:57.722 --> 09:59.599
Shinobu looks angry.

09:59.682 --> 10:01.017
This is a rare sight.

10:01.100 --> 10:02.476
How cool!

10:03.686 --> 10:05.062
Mr. Shinazugawa.

10:05.146 --> 10:07.189
Please don't act rashly.

10:07.857 --> 10:09.900
Brat, what did you say this demon will do?

10:11.319 --> 10:14.822
As a member of Demon Slayer Corps,
she'll fight to protect mankind, right?

10:15.323 --> 10:16.991
That kind of thing

10:18.200 --> 10:20.661
will never happen, you idiot!

10:28.377 --> 10:31.213
The guy who injured my sister!

10:31.297 --> 10:34.008
Whether you're a Hashira or not,
I'll never forgive you!

10:38.971 --> 10:41.182
Really? That's great then.

10:42.975 --> 10:44.060
Stop it!

10:44.143 --> 10:46.354
Lord Oyakata will arrive soon!

11:05.539 --> 11:06.707
Excuse me.

11:11.212 --> 11:12.588
Damn you.

11:13.714 --> 11:16.550
Although Tomioka stepped in,

11:16.634 --> 11:19.261
that brat still knocked down Shinazugawa.

11:20.429 --> 11:24.100
Since you're unable to distinguish
kind demons from vile demons,

11:24.183 --> 11:26.185
I think you might as well
quit being a Hashira!

11:27.311 --> 11:29.230
Damn you.

11:31.982 --> 11:33.859
I will kill you.

11:37.655 --> 11:40.408
-Lord Oyakata has arrived.
-Lord Oyakata has arrived.

11:52.837 --> 11:54.422
You guys are here.

11:58.509 --> 12:01.053
My cute swordsmen.

12:29.331 --> 12:30.833
Good morning, everyone.

12:31.375 --> 12:33.502
Today's weather is great.

12:35.463 --> 12:37.256
The sky is really blue, isn't it?

12:38.048 --> 12:39.967
All the familiar faces are here.

12:40.050 --> 12:43.471
Welcome to the semi-annual
Hashira meeting.

12:43.554 --> 12:44.930
I'm really relieved.

12:46.474 --> 12:47.808
Is he injured?

12:47.892 --> 12:49.477
No. Is he sick?

12:50.352 --> 12:52.146
Is this Lord Oyakata?

12:55.357 --> 12:56.609
He moved so swiftly.

12:56.692 --> 12:58.444
I couldn't react at all.

12:59.028 --> 13:00.112
Damn.

13:12.124 --> 13:15.377
It's great to see you
in good health, Lord Oyakata.

13:16.504 --> 13:19.924
I sincerely wish you good fortune
and may all your hopes be fulfilled.

13:21.383 --> 13:23.219
Thank you, Sanemi.

13:25.346 --> 13:30.100
I wanted to say my greetings
to Lord Oyakata too.

13:31.894 --> 13:33.229
Forgive my bluntness.

13:33.771 --> 13:35.314
Before we begin the Hashira Meeting,

13:35.397 --> 13:38.901
regarding the demon slayer,
Tanjiro Kamado, bringing a demon with him,

13:38.984 --> 13:42.321
can I seek clarification?

13:44.156 --> 13:46.867
This guy clearly
lacks intellect and rationality.

13:46.951 --> 13:49.161
But once he opens his mouth,
he speaks so clearly.

13:50.621 --> 13:52.122
You're right.

13:52.206 --> 13:54.583
Sorry for surprising you guys.

13:55.751 --> 13:59.421
The matter regarding Tanjiro
and Nezuko has my approval.

14:01.632 --> 14:05.094
Therefore, I hope that everyone
can accept them.

14:11.183 --> 14:13.686
Even though it's a request
from Lord Oyakata,

14:13.769 --> 14:16.146
I still have trouble understanding
and accepting it.

14:17.606 --> 14:19.900
I also oppose it flamboyantly.

14:19.984 --> 14:22.987
I can't accept a demon slayer
bringing a demon along.

14:23.904 --> 14:27.700
I'll obey all the requests
of Lord Oyakata.

14:28.659 --> 14:30.327
Actually, it doesn't matter to me.

14:31.579 --> 14:33.330
Since I'll forget about it immediately.

14:40.546 --> 14:43.340
They can't be trusted.

14:43.424 --> 14:45.926
I hate demons the most.

14:46.927 --> 14:49.388
Although I respect Lord Oyakata
from the bottom of my heart,

14:49.471 --> 14:51.515
I can't understand what you're thinking.

14:51.599 --> 14:53.267
I fully oppose it!

14:53.934 --> 14:56.979
Carrying out the task of slaying demons
defines Demon Slayer Corps.

14:57.062 --> 14:59.899
Please severely punish Tomioka
and the other two offenders.

15:05.029 --> 15:06.196
Take the letter.

15:06.989 --> 15:07.907
Yes.

15:14.330 --> 15:17.750
This letter was written
by a former Hashira,

15:17.833 --> 15:20.586
Mr. Sakonji Urokodaki.

15:21.420 --> 15:23.505
I'll read out a small part of the content.

15:25.382 --> 15:30.804
"Please allow Tanjiro Kamado
and her demonic sister to be together.

15:31.722 --> 15:34.558
Nezuko has an unyielding mental power."

15:34.642 --> 15:36.977
She still maintains the rationality
from her humanity.

15:38.103 --> 15:40.689
Even when she's hungry,
she won't eat humans.

15:40.773 --> 15:44.735
Just like that, two years have passed.

15:44.818 --> 15:47.363
Although it's a situation
that will be hard to accept momentarily,

15:47.446 --> 15:49.782
it's definitely the truth.

15:49.865 --> 15:53.452
In case Nezuko attacks humans,

15:53.535 --> 15:55.579
Tanjiro Kamado…

15:55.663 --> 15:59.083
"Sakonji Urokodaki, and Giyu Tomioka
will disembowel oneself

15:59.166 --> 16:01.418
to show gratitude
and take responsibility."

16:18.686 --> 16:21.438
So what if they're willing
to disembowel themselves?

16:22.815 --> 16:25.401
If they want to die,
they might as well just do it now.

16:26.402 --> 16:29.279
That's not a guarantee at all.

16:29.363 --> 16:31.365
Shinazugawa is right!

16:31.448 --> 16:33.993
Killing her after she has eaten
a human is way too late.

16:34.076 --> 16:35.869
The person she murdered
won't come back to life!

16:37.871 --> 16:39.581
You guys are right.

16:40.541 --> 16:42.543
Then, Lord Oyakata…

16:44.211 --> 16:47.214
Indeed, they can't guarantee
that she won't attack humans.

16:47.297 --> 16:49.008
They can't prove it either.

16:51.093 --> 16:52.261
However,

16:53.512 --> 16:57.266
you can't prove that she'll attack humans.

16:59.935 --> 17:02.521
Nezuko has never eaten human flesh
for two years.

17:02.604 --> 17:05.357
This is a fact.

17:05.441 --> 17:08.902
For Nezuko, three people
gambled with their lives.

17:09.445 --> 17:11.488
If you want
to completely deny these things,

17:11.572 --> 17:15.284
the opposing party must also offer
to pay a bigger price.

17:18.746 --> 17:20.831
Does everyone plan to do so?

17:24.418 --> 17:28.505
In addition, there's something
I would like to tell my fellow swordsmen.

17:30.174 --> 17:33.343
Tanjiro has met Kibutsuji.

17:34.678 --> 17:36.263
How's that possible?

17:36.346 --> 17:39.266
Even the Hashiras
have never met Kibutsuji.

17:40.517 --> 17:41.602
This brat?

17:42.102 --> 17:44.480
How does Kibutsuji look like?
How strong is he?

17:44.563 --> 17:45.898
Where did you meet him?

17:46.482 --> 17:47.775
Did you fight with him?

17:48.442 --> 17:50.360
What did Kibutsuji do?

17:50.444 --> 17:52.029
Did you find his lair?

17:52.112 --> 17:53.405
Answer me now!

17:53.489 --> 17:54.448
Shut up!

17:54.531 --> 17:56.200
I asked him first.

17:56.283 --> 17:58.285
Tell me about Kibutsuji's powers.

18:07.878 --> 18:12.299
Kibutsuji sent his subordinates
to kill Tanjiro.

18:13.217 --> 18:16.553
Maybe the reason is to silence him.

18:16.637 --> 18:19.598
But this is the first time
Kibutsuji has given himself away,

18:19.681 --> 18:21.350
I really don't want to let go.

18:22.601 --> 18:27.981
I'm afraid what happened to Nezuko
was beyond Kibutsuji's expectations.

18:31.777 --> 18:33.654
Do you guys understand?

18:37.533 --> 18:40.077
I don't understand, Lord Oyakata.

18:40.160 --> 18:43.747
If she's a human, she can live.
If she's a demon, no way.

18:43.831 --> 18:47.000
Think about the mentality we have
while fighting as demon slayers.

18:47.084 --> 18:49.503
The number of sacrifices we made.

18:50.337 --> 18:51.839
I really can't accept it.

19:01.932 --> 19:04.101
Is he going to do whatever he wants?

19:04.184 --> 19:06.186
His blood is going to stain the ground.

19:07.312 --> 19:08.689
Lord Oyakata.

19:08.772 --> 19:13.277
I'll prove it to you how ugly a demon is.

19:13.944 --> 19:15.070
Sanemi…

19:18.949 --> 19:20.159
Hey, demon.

19:20.242 --> 19:22.077
It's time for your meal.

19:22.161 --> 19:23.495
Come out and eat me.

19:38.302 --> 19:40.262
Don't force yourself.

19:40.345 --> 19:42.639
Just show your true nature.

19:42.723 --> 19:45.225
I'll give you a quick death
with my sword here.

19:45.309 --> 19:46.894
Nezuko!

19:47.561 --> 19:48.729
Shinazugawa.

19:48.812 --> 19:50.397
She can't come out under the sun.

19:51.315 --> 19:54.067
If you don't go under the shade,
the demon won't come out.

19:55.569 --> 19:57.029
Lord Oyakata.

19:57.112 --> 19:59.656
Please pardon my action.

20:08.665 --> 20:10.626
Stop it!

20:13.128 --> 20:14.963
Come out, demon.

20:16.131 --> 20:19.176
I have your favorite human blood here!

20:19.259 --> 20:21.178
I can't breathe.

20:21.261 --> 20:22.554
I can't move.

20:54.086 --> 20:56.922
Nezuko.

20:58.507 --> 21:01.385
DESTROY

22:38.940 --> 22:40.233
PREVIEW

22:41.276 --> 22:44.821
Shinazugawa was actually
headbutted by the newbie.

22:44.905 --> 22:46.573
Indeed, that was an awesome headbutt!

22:46.656 --> 22:48.700
Yes, the sound from the impact
was flamboyant.

22:48.784 --> 22:50.160
It must have hurt.

22:50.243 --> 22:51.620
Namo Amitābha.

22:51.703 --> 22:54.831
But the child dares to confront a Hashira.
He's so brave.

22:54.915 --> 22:56.249
You guys say everything you want.

22:56.333 --> 22:59.002
If it wasn't for Tomioka's interference,
I would've dodged his headbutt.

22:59.086 --> 23:00.253
It sounded like an excuse.

23:01.171 --> 23:03.131
It seems everyone is still the same.

23:03.215 --> 23:05.342
Well, I'll tell you a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:05.425 --> 23:08.804
When we greet Lord Oyakata,
the person who says it first will win.

23:08.887 --> 23:12.432
That's why everyone is uneasy
before Lord Oyakata's arrival.

23:13.308 --> 23:16.645
Next, episode 23, "Hashira Meeting."

23:16.728 --> 23:17.979
TO BE CONTINUED

23:18.063 --> 23:19.106
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
